      "type": "intro",
      "text": "Confirmation of Payee\n\nConfirmation of Payee (CoP) lets a TPP verify that an IBAN belongs to the named account holder before a payment is initiated. The check happens outside the consent and authorisation flow — it requires no user interaction, runs against the LFI that holds the destination account, and returns a name-match result in real time.",
      "metadata": {
        "title": "Confirmation of Payee",
        "source_repo": "Nebras-Open-Finance/community-standards",
